      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَغِنٌ</span></b>  <i>Affected with rancour, malevolence,
malice,</i> or <i>spite;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَاغِنٌ</span></b> . (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَنَاةٌ ضَغِنَةٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>A crooked spear-shaft.</i> (S, K,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَاغِنٌ</span>.

